  ('zcrm_5797994000002316632', 'Renovate', 'Renovate Robotics', 'Ari Gerard', 'CEO', 'Residential roofing is a $60B industry with a broken labor system. Robots have the power to change that. We’re on a mission to reduce accidents and fatalities, protect homes and businesses from severe weather, and accelerate solar deployment.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ari Gerard', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 11:41:19', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
