  ('zcrm_5797994000002331339', 'Roam Robotics', 'Roam Robotics', 'Joseph Foy', 'Tim Swift', 'Roam Robotics is a pioneering exoskeleton technology company developing lightweight, AI-powered wearable robotic systems to enhance human mobility. Their products cater to military, healthcare, and sports performance applications, helping users reduce fatigue, enhance strength, and improve mobility. Unlike traditional exoskeletons, Roam’s solutions use air-powered actuation, making them significantly lighter, more affordable, and adaptable for a wide range of users.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2025', 'LinkedIn', 'Reached Out', 'Joe Foy', 'Rejected', 'Sports & Wellness,Needs Attention', NULL, NULL, '2025-02-26 06:22:19', '2025-04-29 19:06:36', '2025-04-29 19:06:36'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002331365', 'Q30 Innovations', 'Q30', 'Joseph Foy', 'Bruce Angus', 'Q30 Innovations is a sports and medical technology company specializing in trauma-mitigating head and neck protection. Their flagship product, the Q-Collar, is an FDA-cleared, scientifically-backed device designed to reduce brain movement upon impact, lowering the risk of concussions in athletes, military personnel, and industrial workers. The company is pioneering a new approach to brain protection by leveraging internal jugular vein compression (IJC) technology, a method that increases blood volume in the skull to stabilize the brain against rapid movement.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2025', 'LinkedIn', 'Reached Out', 'Joe Foy', 'Rejected', 'Sports & Wellness,Needs Attention', NULL, NULL, '2025-02-26 06:29:49', '2025-04-29 19:06:36', '2025-04-29 19:06:36'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002331391', 'Morpheus Labs', 'Morpheus Labs', 'Joseph Foy', 'Joel Jamieson', 'Morpheus is a fitness and recovery technology company specializing in wearable heart rate tracking to optimize training and recovery. The company’s Morpheus Recovery System uses real-time HRV (heart rate variability) tracking to provide personalized training intensity recommendations, helping athletes and fitness enthusiasts balance exertion and recovery for peak performance. Unlike traditional wearables, Morpheus focuses on individualized recovery scores rather than generic fitness tracking, making it a powerful tool for coaches, trainers, and performance-driven users.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2025', 'LinkedIn', 'Reached Out', 'Joe Foy', 'On Hold', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2025-02-26 06:38:54', '2025-03-01 05:01:21', '2025-03-01 05:01:21'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002331417', 'ZetrOZ Systems', 'ZetrOZ Systems', 'Joseph Foy', 'George K. Lewis Jr.', 'ZetrOZ Systems is a healthcare technology company developing the latest soft tissue healing therapeutics. The company has deep research partnerships with the US Government to develop bioelectronic systems for the delivery of Sustained Acoustic Medicine, combined with activation of Mechanobiology, Pharmacology and Human Physiology.  As a global healthcare company serving millions of patients, our proprietary medical technology platforms are specially designed and formulated for the treatment of acute and chronic musculoskeletal conditions, and our innovations are clinically proven to enhance tissue recovery, accelerate the body’s natural healing processes, and relieve pain.
sam® delivers Sustained Acoustic Medicine safely in the home for the treatment of select medical conditions such as the relief of pain, the relief of muscle spasm, the treatment of joint contracture and the local increase in circulation.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2025', 'LinkedIn', 'Reached Out', 'Joe Foy', 'Rejected', 'Sports & Wellness,Needs Attention', NULL, NULL, '2025-02-26 06:42:35', '2025-04-29 19:06:36', '2025-04-29 19:06:36'),
