  ('zcrm_5797994000002382014', 'NScale', 'NScale', 'Jordan Marquez', 'Micheal Lindenau', 'Nscale is an AI GPU cloud platform that provides scale computing to the generative AI market. It develops AI-ready data centers, deploys GPU infrastructure, and delivers AI cloud services. Its AI private cloud platform supports the entire generative AI lifecycle, enabling developers to run and train AI models.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Jordan Marquez', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-05 07:23:10', '2025-05-08 10:23:31', '2025-05-08 10:23:31'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002382040', 'Edera', 'Edera', 'Jordan Marquez', 'Emily L', 'Edera is a cybersecurity company specializing in strong workload isolation solutions for Kubernetes and AI environments. Its technology employs a cloud-native Type 1 hypervisor to provide robust container isolation, preventing lateral movement and eliminating container escapes. This approach ensures that each container operates within its own isolated kernel, enhancing security without compromising performance. Edera''s platform is designed for seamless integration, requiring minimal configuration to secure workloads across various infrastructures. The company also supports open-source initiatives, offering tools like ''Am I Isolated,'' a Rust-based container runtime scanner that detects gaps in container isolation.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Jordan Marquez', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-05 07:25:50', '2025-05-08 10:02:51', '2025-05-08 10:02:51'),
