  ('zcrm_5797994000002422183', 'Nodal Power', 'Nodal Power', 'Carlo Marano', 'Bryan Black', 'Nodal Power is focused on developing optimized local power systems. Their research involves a system with a generator set that includes a first engine and an output terminal connected to a power distributor. This system is designed to manage a load consisting of multiple sub-loads, each linked to the power distributor. This aligns with their mission to enhance power plant development and boost renewable energy utilization.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Carlo Marano', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-03-07 19:37:08', '2025-04-29 19:01:09', '2025-04-29 19:01:09'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002422209', 'Spiritus', 'Spiritus', 'Carlo Marano', 'Charles Cadieu', 'Spiritus is a climate tech company developing direct-air-capture technology. Its approach combines the Spiritus Sorbent and the Spiritus Carbon Orchard, offering a scalable and modular system for low-cost DAC and sequestration (DAC+S). The company is committed to making carbon removal an accessible and practical tool in the global fight againstclimate change.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Carlo Marano', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-03-07 19:39:44', '2025-04-29 19:01:09', '2025-04-29 19:01:09'),
