  ('zcrm_5797994000002423164', 'Skycision', 'Skycision', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Alec Assaad', 'Skycision aids farmers in detecting crop stress days to weeks earlier than what is possible with the naked eye through the analysis of high-resolution, spectral imagery captured by drones and global satellite constellations. Our solution improves field visibility and mitigates the negative impact an undetected pest or disease could have on a farmers yields through early detection, while also enabling the grower to asses factors like changing climatic conditions that could influence intra-field variability.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-09 11:29:38', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
