  ('zcrm_5797994000002505088', 'Tangram', 'Tangram', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Paris Mielke', 'Tangram is the all-in-one platform for building modern, flexible marketplaces—no massive dev team required. Whether you''re creating a service-based marketplace, product exchange, or niche community, Tangram gives you the building blocks to go live in days, not months.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 21:40:36', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505114', 'Wabbi', 'Wabbi', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Brittany Greenfield', 'Wabbi offers a continuous security platform that enables businesses to ship code that meets their application-specific security standards. Their security teams capture centralized, automated governance by orchestrating each enterprise''s unique application security program, while development teams are empowered to manage security as part of their day-to-day workflows, unifying processes between development, security, and operations teams.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 21:50:55', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505140', 'MGRN', 'MGRN', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Daniel Reaser', 'MRGN is the only platform purpose-built for small businesses that builds and maintains their operating plan and advises the business on how to prepare for real-world events.
MRGN is on a mission to invert the small business attrition rate by closing the knowledge gap between small business owners and their monopolistic corporate counterparts.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 21:54:17', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505166', 'Green Badger', 'Green Badger', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Tommy Linstroth', 'Green Badger is a Software as a Service (SaaS) platform providing easy to use, collaborative, cloud-based solutions to streamline and automate the green building construction market. Green Badger’s LEED Documentation software (featuring web, iOS and Android functionality) is the leading construction automation tool for managing LEED constructiondocumentation and offers construction teams a 60% in labor hours to document compliance, while reducing risk of liquidated damages for missing project goals and LEED contract requirements. We provide tools to make every contractor their own expert in sustainable construction.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 21:57:29', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505193', 'Tracflo', 'Tracflo', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Khalid David', 'TracFlo is an online platform that provides a central location to input, track, and approve changes to construction project cost for subcontractors, general contractors, designers, and owners. It helps manage scope creep and prevent financial disputes at the end of the project.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 22:01:17', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505219', 'ScopeAI', 'ScopeAI', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Luciano Arango', 'ScopeAI automates the process of communicating user insights to product and operation teams. The product leverages natural language processing (a form of AI) to extract insights from customer conversations. It integrates with existing support channels such as Zendesk, Intercom, Desk.com (salesforce) to automatically tag and analyze conversations for trends in customer feedback.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 22:04:41', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505245', 'Inclusology', 'Inclusology', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Cheryl Ingram', 'Inclusology is a SaaS platform dedicated to making the workplace a more inclusive place for all employees. Our platform provides our clients the opportunity to customize (DEI) diversity, equity, and inclusion assessments, automate performance benchmarks, and solutions to help companies solve for unfair workplace practices.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 22:08:29', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505271', 'Anvl', 'Anvl', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Fleming', 'Anvl promotes worker engagement and efficiency with an easy to use mobile application that provides in-the-moment guidance through smart, dynamic workflows. The flexible platform supports safety, quality and operational processes with a configurable user interface, flexible content, triggered process steps and configurable alerts. The applicationcollects and acts on real-time data issuing leading indicator prompts and notifications to both the frontline worker and management when proactive interventions are needed. Leaders benefit from a live feed of data, real-time alerts and remote monitoring of all in-progress and completed workflows. Dashboards, standard and custom reports deliver actionable insights to support continuous improvements and positive cultural changes.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 22:12:11', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505297', 'VenariX', 'VenariX', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Obregon', 'At VenariX, we believe in transforming information into a powerful tool for learning and decision-making. Recognizing the significance of organized and actionable information, we''ve pioneered a cutting-edge cyber insights platform — VenariX. Our platform diligently catalogs and tracks thousands of security incidents from across the globe, withnew entries added daily. Designed to keep pace with the dynamic cyber landscape by continuously updating in near real-time monitoring vast data sources, VenariX''s true strength lies in its capability to deliver clear and concise cyber insights.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 22:16:11', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505323', 'SkyThread', 'SkyThread', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Carcasses', 'SkyThread is an Enterprise Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) company building a Blockchain data exchange network to deliver trust in "Data for the Life of the Aircraft." Their customers are the Maintenance and Overhaul Ecosystem of the skies.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 22:21:38', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505349', 'Enzyme', 'Enzyme', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Graham', 'Enzyme is building software to help life sciences companies with FDA approval and regulatory compliance. Using Enzyme’s software, those companies can avoid spending money on costly consultants which in turn can reduce their compliance costs by up to 50 percent.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 22:27:45', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505375', 'Triparound', 'Triparound', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'antonis@triparound.com', 'Triparound is a software platform (SaaS) for travel companiesthat seek to achieve efficiency, effectiveness and ease of use on their day-to-day business operations. In turn, data will become an asset through which we can provide insights and leverage market expansion opportunities, connecting the dots under our vision of 360⁰ travel and building on the macro trend of millennials’ needs for curated experiences. Our ultimate goal is to commoditize both the efficiency of travel professionals as well as the consumers’ ability to effortlessly create and execute their trips.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 22:37:36', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505402', 'INTECROWD', 'Intecrowd', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'McDougal', 'Intecrowd is the only Workday services partner focused exclusively on payroll integration. It develops easy to maintain solutions and provide support for integration testing as well as updates for new Workday releases', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 22:43:16', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002505429', 'Simius', 'Simius', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Okikiolu', 'Simius is a next-gen cloud security company built to protect users from modern digital threats. We empower individuals and organizations to take control of their networks and reclaim their privacy—without sacrificing speed, usability, or transparency.  With end-to-end encryption, zero-trust architecture, and intelligent threat prevention, Simius makes privacy not just a feature, but a foundation.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Abdulhaq Sani', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-25 23:25:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
